A '''revitalisation (-)''' is a potion that restores the player's drained stats and prayer.

It can only be made in the [[Chambers of Xeric]] with 52 [[Herblore]] by using a [[buchu leaf]] with a [[water-filled gourd vial]] while having a [[stinkhorn mushroom]] in the inventory.

This potion is the weakest variant of the revitalisation potions, and cannot be taken out of the [[Chambers of Xeric]].

